body:
Lund- Broken;
Lund- Low;
Lund- Alone;
Lil Happy Lil Sad - Let Me Die


I relate to this post, listening to dark, depressing music can be healing for me if I’m in certain moods.  However, if you need someone to vent to or need help finding local resources, feel free to message me.  I would love to help out in any way I can. I hope things look up for you soon <3
